      lead: "A Wordle-style daily geography game: guess a country from 4 progressive clues based on fun facts, not maps. Bilingual (ES/EN), with a color aurora that shifts with the time of day.",
      ctaPlay: "Play now",
      ctaCode: "View code on GitHub",
